Skills Demonstrated:

Service Catalog design (catalog items, variables, variable sets)
Approval workflow configuration
Request lifecycle tracking (submitted → approved → fulfilled → closed)
End-user vs. back-end (admin) perspective testing


Key Takeaway:

If all relays are set up, the request will/should move along the chain of command depending on who is issuing the request. The request can be manually approved and closed.
